{
  "key": 42018,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_WatchThisCoin",
      "en_US": [
        "You there.\n",
        "Watch this Coin.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Toi, là-bas.\n",
        "Vise un peu ce Jeton.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_Spin",
      "en_US": "Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin...\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tourne, tourne, tourne...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_LeftOrRightHand",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, which hand is that Coin in?\n",
        "My left or right?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Alors, dans quel main est le Jeton?\n",
        "La gauche ou la droite?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_PoorShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Boo! Poor show!\n",
        "I challenge you to challenge it again!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bouh! La honte!\n",
        "Réessaye un peu pour voir!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_ForOurWinnerACoinCase",
      "en_US": [
        "Bravo!\n",
        "A winner is you!\r",
        "For our winner, I have here...\n",
        "A Coin Case!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bravo!\n",
        "Joli coup!\r",
        "C’est une bien belle victoire, \n",
        "tu as mérité cette Boîte Jetons!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_IAmATearfulClown",
      "en_US": [
        "Me, I am but a tearful clown.\n",
        "Though I smile, I cry inside."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Moi, je ne suis qu’un clown triste.\n",
        "Ce sourire dissimule une âme en peine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneCitySoutheastHouse_Text_ThereAreManyMagicians",
      "en_US": [
        "There are many magicians in the world.\n",
        "You know, the performance artists?\r",
        "Don’t you think that maybe, say,\n",
        "five percent are actually psychics?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il y a beaucoup de magiciens dans le \n",
        "monde. Tu sais, les baguettes, tout ça!\r",
        "Mais en tout, il n’y en a que 5%\n",
        "qui ont de vrais pouvoirs, non?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}